/target/
/generated/
/editors/vscode/dist/
/editors/vscode/node_modules/
*.vsix
**/*.rs.bk

# Go build artifacts inside the spike `dist/` and `runtime/`. The Go source
# files are versioned; binaries and test caches are not.
**/*.exe
/dist/go/dist/
/runtime/go/dist/
/dist/go/vendor/
/runtime/go/vendor/

# Generated output in Lazurite-shaped fixtures — regen-only, do not commit.
examples/*/dist/
examples/*/.lazuli/

# Orion runtime state (per orion-next architecture: pipelines/ and boards/
# are declarative code; runs/ and worktrees/ are runtime).
.orion/runs/
.orion/worktrees/

# Claude Code runtime artifacts generated by orion-mcp resolver.
.claude/agents/_orion-pipeline-*.md
.claude/agents/lazuli-language-architect.md
.claude/commands/lazuli-*.md

# TypeScript build artifacts (runtime/ts and dist/web).
node_modules/
runtime/ts/**/dist/
dist/web/**/dist/
*.tsbuildinfo
.claude/
# The scaffold template ships a `.claude/` payload (the lazuli-architect skill)
# that `lazuli new` copies into every new app — it must be tracked, not ignored.
!lazurite/templates/default/.claude/
!lazurite/templates/default/.claude/**

# Per-agent worktrees for parallel wave implementation (TDD/BDD multi-agent campaign 2026-05-24)
.worktrees/
